  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.33 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions and Programs Regulated by the Board of Nursing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.33 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions and Programs Regulated by the Board of Nursing. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.33, below, shall apply to the professions and programs regulated by the board of nursing under RSA 326-B:\n\nTable 1002.33 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions and Programs Regulated by the Board of Nursing\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nLNA license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $38\n\nMNA certification application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of certification | 2 years | $11\n\nRN or LPN license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $88\n\nAPRN license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nProgram approvals application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of approval | 2 years | $250\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
